5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we say yes. No surprises.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Travel time is the enemy. I need to see how long the trip takes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who pays for what? I need to see the billing structure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know about the bathroom and meal times. Sleep is key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the social dynamics. How do we spend time together?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the travel is too long, the cost of my time is high.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, fair point. But I need the schedule first to judge the value.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the pricing models to see where the money goes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I am checking the inn details. I need a place to sit that is not a bed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look at how last year went. It felt off, but I cannot say why.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I am looking at the offshore house prices. It seems like a good deal.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am checking the ferry and train times. I hate waiting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I am checking the all-in rates versus separate meals. Transparency is key.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I am checking the bathing hours. I need to know when I can wash.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I am checking the time alone in the shared house. I need space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, let's see what we find. I hope it is clear.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be efficient. I don't want to waste a day on logistics.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Clear rules prevent arguments later.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I just want a good night's sleep. That is all.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,We will see. The data will tell us what we need.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
