35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The offshore house is 5,400 yen a head a night. That is cheap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,All-in rates charge the same for everyone. Separate meals are fairer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island house has one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, we were together but felt alone. The shared house had no privacy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, one bathroom? That sounds like a nightmare for five people.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train option is much faster. I prefer the spa town.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the train is fast, but the inn rates are high. 17,000 yen.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I don't care about the price if I can sleep. The inn has fixed meal times.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the inn has fixed times. The city has no timetable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The city bed is 12,000 to 20,000 yen. That is expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The city has trains every few minutes. No planning needed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The city allows separate rooms. That solves the privacy issue.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The city has a door and no timetable. I like that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The city lets us be together or apart. That is what I need.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I am leaning towards the city. The cost is high, but it is clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I agree. The city is efficient. No wasted time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The city is fair. We pay for what we use.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,The city is flexible. I can sleep when I want.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The city balances togetherness and solitude. I vote for it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
